# Register and manage your service

You get a unique client ID when you register your service. You'll need this client ID to integrate each of your services with GOV.UK One Login. 

You should configure a client ID for each environment you have. For example, if you have staging, user acceptance testing, integration and production you should configure 4 client IDs. There's further [guidance on creating a configuration for each service you’re integrating][integrate.client-id].

Registering should take 5 minutes to complete. To register your service to use GOV.UK One Login, you'll need:

* a government email address
* a mobile phone

If you do not have a government email address or mobile phone, you should find a civil servant in your team who can register the service on your behalf. 

Whoever registers the service has the entry tied to their email address. You cannot reassign ownership if someone leaves or add multiple email addresses to a particular client. If you need access after someone has left, you can create an additional client using a different email address and transfer the configuration settings to the new account. 


1. Go to the [Get started with GOV.UK One Login][external.get-started-gov-uk-one-login] page and select **Create admin tool account**. 

1. Follow the onscreen instructions to enter your email address and confirm your email security code. 

1. Enter your mobile number and confirm your mobile security code. 

1. Fill in your client configuration details using this list: 

 

* [Client ID](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#client-id)
* [Client name (Service name)](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#client-name) 
* [Backchannel logout URI](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#backchannel-logout-uri) 
* [Claims](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#claims) 
* [Contacts](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#contacts) 
* [ID token signing algorithm](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#id-token-signing-algorithm) 
* [Landing page URL](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#landing-page-url) 
* [Post-logout URLs](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#post-logout-urls) 
* [Public key](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#public-key) 
* [Redirect URLs](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#redirect-urls) 
* [Scopes](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#scopes) 
* [Sector identifier URI](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#sector-identifier-uri) 
* [Token authentication method](/before-integrating/create-individual-configurations-for-each-service/#token-authentication-method)

 

